llama-cpp-python (0:0.3.35-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Start new split-package layout.
  * Add core package and dynamically dispatched CPU backend package.
  * Add transitional packages for the old CPU package names.
  * Add split Vulkan backend and transition from python3-llama-cpp-vulkan.
  * Finalize phase 2 package layout and backend naming.
  * Add Debian Trixie CUDA 12.4 dynamic backend and legacy CUDA transition.
  * Add co-installable NVIDIA CUDA 12.9 and CUDA 13.3 dynamic backends.
  * Add broad-target AMD ROCm 7.14 HIP dynamic backend.

